[b]Hey folks![/b] 

Last week we making our best to [b]improve our game[/b] based on the received feedback! 

Our game has the next big updates:

- Upgrade project to [b]Unreal Engine 5[/b] and enabled [b]Lumen[/b];

- Redesigned [b]Shooter Mechanic[/b] with new [b]Procedural Animations[/b];

- Updated [b]Level Design[/b];

- Updated [b]Inspiration Mechanic[/b] from Inventory;

And you can try it!

When and where? Well, you will have the chance to touch the beauty of Demo on the [b]Game Gathering Conference 2023[/b] at [b]5-6 August[/b] which will take the place in Kyiv!
